Executes pending workspace migrations and tracks applied state in .orbit/migrations.json.

Usage:
  orbit migrate [flags]
  orbit migrate [command]

Available Commands:
  status      Show status of all registered workspace migrations

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for migrate
      --json   Print the result as a JSON envelope

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit migrate [command] --help" for more information about a command.
